From: Sebastien Merle <sebastien.merle@stritzinger.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add explicit native application launch and shutdown mode

Keep the BEAM path and operating-system setup unchanged. Native mode skips
ERTS discovery, launches one absolute executable, and signals it before a
bounded graceful shutdown. Carry this as a local Alloy package extension.

